# 02: Migrate CLI composition

**Blocked by:** 01
**Status:** open

## Delivery

CLI startup obtains its configured provider through application composition.

## Design context

This consumer preserves [provider behavior](../requirements.md#provider-behavior) while adopting the selection interface introduced by [application provider selection](01-expand-composition.example) under the approved [provider composition seam](../design.md#provider-composition-seam).

## Touch points

CLI composition root and startup behavior tests.

## Changes

1. Replace direct web construction with application selection.

## Constraints

Missing-configuration behavior remains unchanged.

## Done and verify

CLI startup selects the same provider for configured and missing-configuration cases; run `go test ./internal/command/...`.
